    "text": "Released on 23 April 2021 alongside the twin expansions Silver Lance and Jet-Black Spirit. Each set held four booster packs, two of each expansion, a Calyrex coin in a matching colour and one of two fixed three-card packs: Ice Rider Calyrex V or Shadow Rider Calyrex V, the Legendary Pokémon merged with Glastrier or Spectrier, with a Trainer and a Special Energy card that support its type. The six cards carry their own set mark and number."
